# CampusShare — Email Service Configuration (Nodemailer)
#
# Option 1: Using Gmail (Recommended & Free)
# 1. Go to your Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification (turn on if not already)
# 2. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an App Name (e.g. "CampusShare") and click Create
# 4. Copy the 16-character password into SMTP_PASS below (no spaces)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your_16_character_app_password
EMAIL_FROM="CampusShare (AIT Pune)" <your_email@gmail.com>

# Option 2: Using Any College/Custom SMTP Server (e.g. Brevo, SendGrid, Office365)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp-relay.brevo.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_smtp_login
# SMTP_PASS=your_smtp_password

